flowchart TD
    A[Teacher describes a situation] --> B{Input guardrail}
    B -- blocked --> X[Stop with a message]
    B -- ok --> C[Interpret: model builds a profile]
    C --> D{Profile valid?}
    D -- no --> E[Keyword fallback profile]
    D -- yes --> F[Retrieve candidates]
    E --> F
    N[(Practice notes)] --> F
    G[(Virtue guides)] --> F
    F --> H[Rank with scorer and reasons]
    P[(practices.csv)] --> H
    H --> I[Explain: model words the reasons]
    I --> J{Output guardrail}
    J -- fail --> K[Show scorer reasons only]
    J -- pass --> L[Top 3 with reasons and sources]
    K --> L
    L --> M[Teacher accepts or rejects]
    L --> T[(Trace log)]
